// Canned ollaya /api/decide responder.
// Reads the ticket text from the request body (field "state", same as the real API)
// and answers with the matching canned response. Unknown tickets get the
// low-confidence "hmm" answer - which the demo workflow correctly routes to human_review.
// To use REAL captures instead, replace the CANNED object below with the contents of
// fallback/canned/*.json after running fallback/capture-canned.sh.
